 36189                           ;	Clock Switch Enable bit
 36190                           ;	CSWEN = ON, Writing to NOSC and NDIV is allowed
 36191                           ;	JTAG Enable bit
 36192                           ;	JTAGEN = OFF, Disable JTAG Boundary Scan mode, JTAG pins revert to user functions
