 36195                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor -Primary XTAL Enable bit
 36196                           ;	FCMENP = ON, FSCM timer will set FSCMP bit and OSFIF interrupt on Primary XTAL failure
 36197                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor -Secondary XTAL Enable bit
 36198                           ;	FCMENS = ON, FSCM timer will set FSCMS bit and OSFIF interrupt on Secondary XTAL failu
      +                          re
